      "text": "[4:18PM] #AjegunleApapa #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular Movement from High Bridge down to Area B Apapa on both lanes is good to go.\nTraffic around Total Underneath the Bridge connecting Naval Dockyard is flowing efficiently. \n\nMarine Beach Bus Stop inward Ijora Badia is good to go.\nSteady movement within Boundary Roundabout.\nMovement on Mobil Road inward and outward is fast paced. \n\nThere are no Impediment recorded in these area at present, and our men are on ground monitoring the flow of traffic. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
